]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"26":["And it [was] an hand breadth thick, and the brim thereof was wrought like the brim of a cup, with flowers of lilies: it contained two thousand baths.",[[[[143,148]],[9]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"27":["And he made ten bases of brass; four cubits [was] the length of one base, and four cubits the breadth thereof, and three cubits the height of it.",[[[[12,15]],[3]],[[[111,114],[115,120]],[13]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"32":["And under the borders [were] four wheels; and the axletrees of the wheels [were joined] to the base: and the height of a wheel [was] a cubit and half a cubit.",[[[[121,126]],[8]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"33":["And the work of the wheels [was] like the work of a chariot wheel: their axletrees, and their naves, and their felloes, and their spokes, [were] all molten.",[[[[16,19],[20,26]],[1]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"35":["And in the top of the base [was there] a round compass of half a cubit high: and on the top of the base the ledges thereof and the borders thereof [were] of the same.",[[[[63,64],[65,70]],[3]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"46":["In the plain of Jordan did the king cast them, in the clay ground between Succoth and Zarthan.",[[[[27,30],[31,35]],[3]]],"crosswire-hebrew"]},"ylt":{"1":["And his own house hath Solomon built thirteen years, and he finisheth all his house.",[[[[23,30]],[3]]],"dual-names"]},"dby":{"1":["And Solomon was thirteen years building his own house; and he finished all his house.",[[[[4,11]],[3]]],"dual-names"]},"webster":{"1":["But Solomon was building his own house thirteen years, and he finished all his house.",[[[[4,11]],[3]]],"dual-names"]},"rv":{"1":["And Solomon was building his own house thirteen years, and he finished all his house.",[[[[4,11]],[3]]],"dual-names"]},"dra":{"1":["And Solomon built his own house in thirteen years, and brought it to perfection.",[[[[4,11]],[3]]],"dual-names"]}}}
